cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these simulations in teaching or research, please cite this catalog."
title: "Eureka Express — Open Simulations"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Kudzu Partners S.L. (Eureka Simulations)"
    city: "Barcelona"
    country: "ES"
    website: "https://www.eurekasimulations.com/"
abstract: >-
  An open catalog of playable business simulations in the Universal Simulation
  Framework (USF) format. Each simulation is a self-contained JSON (model, UI,
  styles, EN/ES translations) runnable in the browser with the bundled
  standalone player. Topics span business, finance, hospitality, tourism,
  sustainability, and education.
keywords:
  - business simulation
  - experiential learning
  - management education
  - serious games
  - open educational resources
license: CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Kudzu-Partners/Simulations"
url: "https://open.eurekasimulations.com/player/"
version: "2026.07"
date-released: "2026-07-24"
